---
source: crates/specforge-cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Load the built component and report its declaration's diagnostics

Usage: specforge extension validate [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          Path to the extension project
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
